{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/190160-help-me-name-my-sidereal","id":190160,"title":"Help Me Name My Sidereal","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-07T05:21:31-07:00","id":190160,"title":"Help Me Name My Sidereal","content":"So, my character's gonna be a trickster mentor-type Gold Faction Chosen of Secrets for our group of naive and inexperienced solars (and their less naive and inexperienced lunar mates). The question is: how should I name him? (I also need a name for the Resplendent Destiny I'm currently wearing.)<br /> <br /> Since I'm incapable of taking things seriously, I've decided to follow my usual practice of &quot;when in doubt, use a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ships_(The_Culture)\" target=\"_blank\">Culture ship name</a>&quot;. A few I've thought were semi-appropriate (some of them are, others still need to be exalt-ified):<br /> <br /> <b>Credibility Problem</b>: it's a very sidereal mentor-name.<br /> <b>Prosthetic Conviction</b>: 'cause I'm the high-conviction do-what-must-be-done kind of guy amidst a group of idealists. I'm somewhat iffy on using the word &quot;prosthetic&quot; in a fantasy game, though.<br /> <b>Fallen Outside of Normal Moral Constraints</b>, <b>Victim of the Ambient Morality</b> and <b>Ethics Gradient</b> also riff off this theme, kinda.<br /> <b>Reasonable Excuse</b> and <b>Honest Mistake</b> are perhaps more appropriate to Bronze Faction, but the latter could go either way, really. If we're talking factions, <b>Recent Convert</b> is a perfectly good goldie name.<br /> <b>Wit Amidst Folly</b>: mentor for a group of naive solars, again. Also, Chosen of Secrets, being smug is part of the job.<br /> Fairly good Chosen of Secrets names also include <b>Unreliable Witness</b> and <b>Graceful Avoidance of Awkward Facts</b>.<br /> <br /> I need to choose two, and convert them to the standard Adjective-plus-Noun-related-to-nature format of Exalted names. What do you think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T05:49:21-07:00","id":190189,"title":"","content":"I think you should discard all of these and use the best Culture Ship name ever - &quot;It's My Party and I'll Sing If I Want To.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hmm... Narrow Reveling Song?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T06:06:55-07:00","id":190199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/190160-help-me-name-my-sidereal?p=190189#post190189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think you should discard all of these and use the best Culture Ship name ever - &quot;It's My Party and I'll Sing If I Want To.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That's more of a Chosen of Serenity name, I figured :P<br /> <br /> (Also, is <b>Outstanding Contribution to the Historical Process</b> the best name ever for a Chosen of Battles, or the best name ever for a Chosen of Endings? Probably both.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T06:16:50-07:00","id":190205,"title":"","content":"<b>Sixth Division of Unilateral Jurisdiction</b> was one of the greatest Chosen of Jupiter.... when he didn't insist on wearing a black suit and eye-obscuring sunglasses. We shortened it to <b>J.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T04:37:54-07:00","id":226910,"title":"","content":"Soliloquy of Unfathomable Dictum (just can't keep their mouth shut)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3683-kageryu","name":"Kageryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:24:58-07:00","id":227041,"title":"","content":"What about a Jade Empire-like name, such as... Honest Ling? Reliable Mei Li?<br /> <br /> Because, think of what their reactions will be to a Chosen of Secrets who introduces herself, &quot;Pleased to meet you, Chosen of the Sun and Moon. I am <i>Honest Ling.</i>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2536-tsk","name":"TSk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2536_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:30:51-07:00","id":227046,"title":"","content":"Or, to go in the complete opposite direction, Fu-Ling-Yu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:37:54-07:00","id":227053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/190160-help-me-name-my-sidereal?p=227046#post227046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or, to go in the complete opposite direction, <b>Fu-Ling-Yu</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>This gives me <i>life</i>.<br /> <br /> \u798f\u4f36\u745c (f\u00fa l\u00edng y\u00fa)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:48:00-07:00","id":227061,"title":"","content":"Other possibilities:<br /> <br /> Veracious Sheng<br /> Truthful Hu<br /> Veritable Lifang<br /> Guileless Zhou<br /> <br /> And, I mean, it might be merely your common name. Your full Sidereal epithet could still be something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2536-tsk","name":"TSk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2536_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:51:54-07:00","id":227063,"title":"","content":"Ooh, I like these... as for suggestions:<br /> <br /> <b>Unfortunate Conflict of Evidence</b>, maybe? Although, as a name, it might be a little contrived.<br /> <b>Congenital Optimist</b> doesn't have that problem. It'd be great for someone with that outlook - or hysterically ironic if he's more that <i>other</i> type.<br /> <b>Stranger Here Myself</b> is also appropriate for a Siddie (or their resplendent destiny cover), if perhaps a little on-the-nose.<br /> <b>Wisdom Like Silence</b> sounds seamlessly Exalted-y to me.<br /> <b>Sober Counsel</b> is also not too bad on that score, in addition to sounding mentor-like.<br /> Ditto <b>Conventional Wisdom</b>, or <b>Lucid Nonsense</b> for a more humorous spin.<br /> <b>Inappropriate Response</b> and <b>Lapsed Pacifist</b> also stick out has having potential, though maybe more for a RedSid - the latter especially.<br /> <br /> Less character-specific, but both plausible and hilarious when you consider that in most cultures it's usually the parents who do the naming:<br /> <br /> <b>Youthful Indiscretion<br /> I Blame Your Mother</b><br /> <b>Someone Else's Problem</b><br /> <br /> And those are just the ones that don't call for much adjusting. You've pointed me to a wonderful resource here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, because apparently I can't <i>not</i> see something like this without instantly relating it to Abyssals, I'm totally gonna try to do something with <b>The End of Invention</b> at some point.<br /> <br /> Also also, <b>Irregular Apocalypse</b>. Just because it sounds far too badass not to mention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/471-cenobite451","name":"Cenobite451","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar471_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:53:18-07:00","id":227064,"title":"","content":"My best-named Sidereal was a Chosen of Serenity called <b>Sticks-and-Stones. </b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T09:43:54-07:00","id":227079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/190160-help-me-name-my-sidereal?p=227064#post227064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My best-named Sidereal was a Chosen of Serenity called <b>Sticks-and-Stones. </b></div> </div> </div> </div>The only way that name could get any better would be if he killed people with namecalling.<br /> &quot;Your mother was a hamster and your father smelt of elderberries!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T11:38:52-07:00","id":227165,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/190160-help-me-name-my-sidereal?p=227079#post227079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The only way that name could get any better would be if he killed people with namecalling.<br /> &quot;Your mother was a hamster and your father smelt of elderberries!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Now go away, or I shall taunt you a second time!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}